This product includes and builds upon third-party work:

- Qwen-Image-2.1 (Alibaba / Qwen). This repository is an independent Rust
  inference port reverse-engineered from the diffusers implementation. It
  contains NO model weights. The weights are distributed by Qwen under the
  Qwen Research License (research-only) and must be obtained separately.

- SageAttention (thu-ml), Apache License 2.0. The sm80 INT8-QK/FP16-PV fused
  attention kernel and its headers are vendored under kernels/sage/vendor/
  (the torch bindings were stripped). Upstream:
  https://github.com/thu-ml/SageAttention

- NVIDIA CUTLASS, used (not vendored) for the INT8 GEMM and its epilogue.
  https://github.com/NVIDIA/cutlass

- candle (Hugging Face), the CUDA/tensor spine. Apache-2.0 / MIT.
  https://github.com/huggingface/candle

- The ConvRot W8A8 scheme follows pytorch/ao's group-wise Regular Hadamard
  rotation for DiTs.
